{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nilesthump/IM-platform/pulls/40","id":4873055234,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUhPg3c8AAAABInTsAg","html_url":"https://github.com/nilesthump/IM-platform/pull/40","diff_url":"https://github.com/nilesthump/IM-platform/pull/40.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nilesthump/IM-platform/pull/40.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nilesthump/IM-platform/issues/40","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nilesthump/IM-platform/pulls/40/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nilesthump/IM-platform/pulls/40/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nilesthump/IM-platform/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nilesthump/IM-platform/issues/40/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nilesthump/IM-platform/statuses/63f685d1b959b318f97d804f40af49d61aa3f273","number":40,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"修正静默兜底并加入提交 CI 前的独立错误审查","user":{"login":"nilesthump","id":211787881,"node_id":"U_kgDODJ-gaQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/211787881?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nilesthump","html_url":"https://github.com/nilesthump","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nilesthump/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nilesthump/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nilesthump/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nilesthump/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nilesthump/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nilesthump/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nilesthump/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nilesthump/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nilesthump/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"生产代码中的宽泛捕获、空结果回退和错误包装会掩盖内部失败，部分调用还会把数据库不可用误报成 Session 撤销，或在清理失败后遗漏已启动的操作。本次按现有架构逐项审查 185 个生产输入，修正其中 42 个输入，并记录 339 条精确处理依据（304 条可执行、35 条非执行）。\r\n\r\n主要变化：\r\n- 修正 Outbox 默认 pgx 混合错误、Gateway WSS 写失败及巡检错误分类；保留必要的连接关闭和可靠投递行为。\r\n- 收窄 Web、Desktop、Android 和共享 SDK 的真实传输/存储来源边界，使未知回调、解析及状态发布错误保留原始失败。\r\n- 修正 Android WSS/HTTP 资源清理及 Desktop 生命周期中的多错误覆盖、遗漏清理和晚到 Promise 错误；保留账号、操作和 generation/revision 约束。\r\n- 按 Human 的明确授权，仅修正 shared/mobile `Repository.contiguous` 两处只读映射：无记录仍为 0，已有无效序号明确失败。SQLite SQL、Schema、事务、写入行为和草稿逻辑不变。\r\n- 在 AGENTS、治理规范、审查清单和 Task 模板中固定“实现 → 新常规独立 Review → 另一个全新错误处理专项审查 → GitHub CI”；新增规则与四个最小示例，不增加通用错误处理框架。\r\n\r\n已知故障仍按当前权威处理：事务回滚、资源清理、网络 FAILED、协议拒绝、账号隔离及提交结果不确定性保护均保留。Frozen Architecture、公开契约、依赖和技术选择未改。\r\n\r\n本地验证包括真实 PostgreSQL 16/NATS 2.10 完整 Go suite（无跳过）、Go race/vet、默认 pgx 与实际 WebSocket 故障控制、Desktop 新 39 项及原 owner12/parallel37/Auth 控制、架构检查与干净提交 Acceptance。较早的原生 Android/SQLx/Send/Sync 实测仅在精确未变输入图范围内引用；专用 Desktop 和 Android 错误回归不冒称已有 hosted 入口。Social 403 沿用既有 Human 豁免，未执行且不计规范 PASS。\r\n\r\n最终候选：`63f685d1b959b318f97d804f40af49d61aa3f273`。两项提交前审查均已正式 PASS：\r\n- `/root/regular_review_63f685d`：PASS_REGULAR_REVIEW_ONLY，275 artifacts，收据 SHA256 `331eff21a35b60653d7618dddf7be51f38ad05d29c2b8043cbba16074b36da3e`。\r\n- `/root/error_audit_63f685d`：PASS_SPECIALIZED_ERROR_HANDLING_AUDIT_ONLY，311 artifacts，收据 SHA256 `598f58af70b83763eadb28fbf08a0cdf244cf731426e4b228e3b416470f122b6`。\r\n\r\n两者为不同全新上下文，未参与该候选实现/Fix；专项审查亦未参与常规 Review。完整收据位于协调器外部封存目录，行政闭环将提交可恢复引用。专项 Recorder 的一次命令启动前 WinError2 与可选 native probe 参数缺失均已披露，未伪造执行成功或改写 trace。\r\n\r\n主仓库安全同步和任务完成仍由后续真实 exact-head CI、受保护集成、actual-main 验证及同步证据确定。S2 Gate 保持 OPEN。\r\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-15T12:13:47Z","updated_at":"2026-10-15T12:24:28Z","closed_at":"2026-10-15T12:24:27Z","merged_at":"2026-10-15T12:24:27Z","merge_commit_sha":"1cab3dc4c9180bfe6a6654fde028a0354faf8a4c","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"nilesthump:task/LOOP1-ERROR-HANDLING-001","ref":"task/LOOP1-ERROR